From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:47:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xodus: Ask xodus-service for the account's game license.

XodusRequestGameLicense() sends GAME_LICENSE_REQUEST (100) with a title's Store product id and
market and reads GAME_LICENSE_RESPONSE (101): whether the license is active, whether it is a
trial, and its SKU. xodus-service asks the Store's licensing service with the account's Microsoft
tokens, which only it holds. A service that does not know the request answers with an empty
message, reported as E_NOTIMPL.

Original work for macrock (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Topic: game-license
